# Change Log — AbhiHub

All notable changes to the `.agent` directory and project documentation will be documented here.

## 2026-08-24 — Initial Restructuring + M3 + L3 Implementation

### Changes — `.agent/` Restructuring
- Created `.agent/` directory structure per "rules-first development agent" skill (rules/, memory/, tasks/, history/, logs/)
- Created `.agent/rules/project-rules.md` with all critical rules: PDF viewer policy, app directory rule, authentication, quota, no print(), import rules, documentation rules, verification rules
- Created `.agent/memory/flashcard.md` with project purpose, architecture overview, technology stack, important paths, critical constraints, frequently used commands, key decisions
