- Created `.agent/memory/important-notes.md` with PDF viewer policy, auth rules, import hygiene, print() issues, CORS config, quota system, route verification, fuzzy search migration, hardcoded dates, input validation, rank lookup, dashboard categorization, SocketIO security, dead code, Turnstile sitekey, anon key docs, test secrets, |tojson|safe
- Created `.agent/tasks/ongoing.md` with Phase 1+2+3 tasks
- Created `.agent/tasks/completed.md` with all completed tasks
- Created `.agent/history/task-001.md` with task history for .agent restructuring
- Created `.agent/logs/changes.log` as the change log foundation

