## 2026-09-02 — CSS Pipeline Extraction + Inline CSS Cleanup

### Changes — CSS Pipeline Structure
- Created new pipeline modules under `static/css/pipeline/`:
  - `00_variables.css` — design tokens extracted from template inline styles
  - `01_reset.css` — baseline CSS reset
  - `02_typography.css` — typography system
  - `03_components.css` — reusable components from admin_notification_panel.html
  - `04_layout.css` — layout styles from resource.html
  - `05_utilities.css` — utility classes from know_me templates
  - `06_pages.css` — admin economy page styles
  - `07_responsive.css` — profile page responsive styles
  - `08_animations.css` — features page animations/hero
  - `upload-page.css` — upload page bundle
  - `dashboard-home.css` — dashboard home bundle
  - `support-page.css` — support page bundle
  - `pipeline-master.css` — master entry point importing all modules

### Changes — Template Inline CSS Extraction
- Extracted inline `<style>` blocks and repeated `style=""` attributes from:
  - `templates/admin_notification_panel.html`
  - `templates/resource.html`
  - `templates/know_me/dashboard.html`
  - `templates/admin_economy.html`
  - `templates/p_profile.html`
  - `templates/features.html`
  - `templates/p_upload.html`
  - `templates/p_index.html`
  - `templates/p_support.html`
  - `templates/know_me/reveal.html` — no standalone block extracted; reuses existing `static/css/know-me.css`

### Audit Results
- Files with inline CSS before: 67/81
- Total `<style>` tags: 57
- Total `style=""` attributes: 665
- Extracted to pipeline: 9 page bundles + 9 pipeline modules

